sequenceDiagram
    participant Planner
    participant Executor
    participant Sandbox@{ "type": "boundary" }
    participant Model as Judge model

    Planner->>Executor: run(plan 3 steps)
    loop per step
        Executor->>+Sandbox: exec(step)
        alt exit 0
            Sandbox-->>-Executor: stdout, 40ms
        else non-zero exit
            Sandbox--xExecutor: exit 1, stderr
            Executor->>+Model: repair(step, stderr)
            Model-->>-Executor: patched step
        end
    end
    Executor-->>Planner: 3 of 3 steps green
    Note over Planner,Model: A repaired step is rerun once before the plan fails
